{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想養成閱讀、冥想、運動或學習新知識的習慣，卻總是半途而廢？《HabitoX》以簡潔專注的設計，透過優雅的每日日曆與智能提醒，協助你建立有意義的習慣並持續堅持。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>日曆記錄習慣連續達標</h2>\n<p>每完成一項習慣，連續達標紀錄與動力便會隨之增長。清晰的視覺化日曆讓你一眼掌握進度，看見每日微小行動如何隨時間累積。溫和的通知提醒你不會遺忘真正重要的小步伐；持續堅持還可獲得徽章與經驗值，把成果變成看得見的里程碑。內置簡易圖表助你瞭解習慣變化、掌握穩定節奏與改善空間，介面極簡且無干擾。全部資料離線儲存於裝置，無需帳戶、不經伺服器、不收集數據。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-230-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-231-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-232-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-233-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-234-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-235-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：HabitoX</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T08:02:05.732491+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T07:26:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T07:58:23.053929+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T07:58:23.053929+00:00","content_hash":"85fb135a153c77beba71c3e07d8a4eb09c9313d178bcfde5c384dd105f4891e3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}